# Build context for both apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile is now
# the repo root (see docker-compose.yml), replacing the old per-app
# apps/api/.dockerignore and apps/web/.dockerignore -- Docker only reads one
# .dockerignore at the root of the build context, so those two are gone and
# this one covers both images.
**/node_modules
**/dist
.git
.env
.env.local
apps/*/.env
apps/*/.env.local
